BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yuri Gorbachev 23rd Annual Exhibition at The Byrne Gallery
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261104
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270104
DTSTAMP:20261121T161137Z
UID:yuri-gorbachev-23rd-annual-exhibition-at-the-byrne-gallery-2026-11-04@
 middleburg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitmiddleburgva.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/10/Yuri-Gorbachev.png
DESCRIPTION:The Byrne Gallery announces its 31st anniversary this year wit
 h a celebration and exhibition of vivid oil and enamel paintings of intern
 ationally acclaimed artist Yuri Gorbachev. The Byrne Gallery welcomes Yuri
  Gorbachev for his 23rd annual exhibition in Middleburg\, Virginia. The Ga
 llery will feature some of his classic paintings along with new works from
  his 2026 museum tour. In 2026\, he showed at venues in Talin Estonia\, He
 lsinki Finland\, Prague Czech Republic\, and Berlin Germany as well as Gal
 lery Chang in New York City and Seoul\, Korea.    The opening reception wi
 ll be on November 14\, 2026 from 5:30 p.m. to 8:00 p.m. The exhibition is 
 open to the public and everyone is cordially invited to attend. The exhibi
 tion begins on November 4th and continues through January 3rd\, 2027.    T
 his year a portion of the sales from the exhibition will be donated to the
  families of Ukraine through The International Rescue Committee (IRC) for 
 Ukrainian Refugees. This organization is consistently awarded top marks by
  charity watchdog groups for efficient use of contributions and overall im
 pact.\n\nDetails: https://visitmiddleburgva.com/events/yuri-gorbachev-23rd
 -annual-exhibition-at-the-byrne-gallery/
LOCATION:The Byrne Gallery\, 7 W Washington St\, Middleburg\, VA 20117
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://visitmiddleburgva.com/events/yuri-gorbachev-23rd-annual-exhibi
 tion-at-the-byrne-gallery/
END:VEVENT
