BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Complimentary Journal Personalization at Every Little Something
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261120T120000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261120T170000
DTSTAMP:20261121T161137Z
UID:complimentary-journal-personalization-at-every-little-someth-2026-11-2
 0@middleburg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitmiddleburgva.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/10/Personalized-Journal-Day-ELS.png
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Every Little Something in Middleburg for a special 
 in-store personalization event featuring our collection of Semikolon journ
 als and notebooks.    Choose your favorite Semikolon notebook in the shop
 \, and we’ll personalize it for you free of charge using our hot-foil st
 amping equipment.    Add a name\, initials\, word or one of our available 
 emoji designs to make your notebook your own — or create a personalized 
 gift for someone else.    While you’re here\, enjoy a fresh-baked cookie
  from our neighbors at Upper Crust\, Middleburg’s local bakery.    The c
 ookies are on us and meant to be enjoyed by everyone who stops by — no p
 urchase necessary.    Click here for more details!\n\nDetails: https://vis
 itmiddleburgva.com/events/complimentary-journal-personalization-at-every-l
 ittle-something/
LOCATION:Every Little Something\, 109 West Washington Street\, Middleburg
 \, VA 20117
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://visitmiddleburgva.com/events/complimentary-journal-personaliza
 tion-at-every-little-something/
