 ratitude\, inspiration\, and painting your 2027 vision on canvas with loca
 l artist\, Christina Lee at the Middleburg Community Center!    Imagine 20
 27: A Canvas of Possibilities is an in-person creative afternoon for the c
 ommunity. Gratitude\, inspiration\, and possibility.    Discover what you 
 truly would love for the year ahead with Life Coach\, DeeAnn Jeremiah. Cre
 atively imagine it with local artist\, Christina Lee. Bring your vision fo
 r 2027 to life on canvas in a relaxed\, fun & creative setting!    Click h
 ere to register!\n\nDetails: https://visitmiddleburgva.com/events/imagine-
 2027-a-canvas-of-possibilities/
