BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Celebrate Thanksgiving in Middleburg!
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261123
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261129
DTSTAMP:20261121T161137Z
UID:celebrate-thanksgiving-in-middleburg-2026-11-23@middleburg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitmiddleburgva.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2024/10/Thanksgiving-Dinner.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Would you rather make a reservation this Thanksgiving? Fear no
 t! Middleburg has you covered. Each venue offers a unique atmosphere and m
 enu\, making them great choices for Thanksgiving dining. Whether you're lo
 oking for a cozy tavern vibe or a lavish buffet\, there's something for ev
 eryone!    Red Fox Inn & Tavern Thanksgiving Harvest Dinner  Celebrate the
  season at The Red Fox Inn & Tavern\, where historic charm\, warm hospital
 ity and exceptional dining come together. Gather with family and friends t
 o savor autumn flavors and enjoy a memorable evening in the heart of Middl
 eburg. This special dining experience runs November 23-25 and November 27-
 28.  The Red Fox is closed on Thanksgiving Day\, November 26.    Click her
 e for reservations!    Salamander Grand Thanksgiving Buffet  The Salamande
 r Middleburg Grand Thanksgiving Buffet offers a luxurious dining experienc
 e. This expansive buffet features a wide array of dishes\, from traditiona
 l roasted turkey to gourmet sides and delectable desserts. The elegant set
 ting and attentive service ensure a memorable experience for all. Guests c
 an enjoy a festive atmosphere\, complete with live music and seasonal deco
 rations.    Click here for reservations.    Harrimans Thanksgiving Feast  
 Harrimans provides a refined dining experience for Thanksgiving\, focusing
  on seasonal\, locally sourced ingredients. The menu highlights classic ho
 liday dishes with a modern twist\, including perfectly roasted turkey\, un
 ique sides\, and artisanal desserts. The restaurant's sophisticated ambian
 ce and exceptional service make it a wonderful choice for those looking to
  celebrate in style.    Click here for reservations.\n\nDetails: https://v
 isitmiddleburgva.com/events/dine-out-in-middleburg-this-thanksgiving-582/
LOCATION:Middleburg\, VA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://visitmiddleburgva.com/events/dine-out-in-middleburg-this-thank
 sgiving-582/
END:VEVENT
